title: Member Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/10kr.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Member Fundraising

Beyond the regular dues, there are always ways to raise a little extra from our members.

- @collection_drive: Organize a collection drive.
- @lottery: Run a members' lottery.
- @nothing: Do not organize any fundraising this month.

@collection_drive
subtitle: +10 resources.
on-arrival: resources += 10;

Our local branches organize a small collection among the membership, and the modest sum raised goes straight into our coffers.

@lottery
subtitle: -10 resources, a chance at more.
choose-if: resources >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 10;
Q.lottery_won = (Math.random() < 0.35) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.lottery_won) {
  Q.resources += 50;
}
!}

We print a batch of lottery tickets and sell them among our members and sympathizers.

[? if lottery_won : Fortune smiles on us this time - ticket sales far exceed the prizes we pay out, netting us a tidy sum. ?][? if not lottery_won : Unfortunately, the prizes we pay out swallow up the ticket sales, and we are left out of pocket. ?]

@nothing

We do not organize any fundraising this month.
